{"meta":{"id":"b1130804-c4ab-457a-9f8b-4bde710c2dc7","publication_id":"30c7e4c1-15ed-46d8-a23d-32c90e011794","web_title":"SCF 7.0 explicado en profundidad: guía práctica para entender el proceso de funding en Stellar","parameterized_web_title":"scf-7-0-explicado-en-profundidad-guia-practica-para-entender-el-proceso-de-funding-en-stellar","utm_params_enabled":true,"utm_campaign":"scf-7-0-explicado-en-profundidad-guia-practica-para-entender-el-proceso-de-funding-en-stellar","utm_medium":"referral","utm_source":"blog.telluscoop.com","web_subtitle":"El Stellar Community Fund (SCF) es uno de los programas de financiamiento más relevantes del ecosistema Web3 cuando hablamos de impacto real, productos en producción y uso on-chain. Con el lanzamiento oficial de SCF 7.0 en enero de 2026, la Stellar Development Foundation (SDF) realizó uno de los rediseños más profundos del programa desde su creación.","web_audiences":"free","status":"published","active":true,"featured":false,"override_scheduled_at":"2026-01-20T12:56:30.664Z","slug":"scf7-0","is_premium":false,"image_url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/asset/file/c7fc344e-19ae-4e8b-a266-d6a8290d8da3/scfarticle.jpg?t=1768917574","image_width":1200,"image_height":630,"meta_default_title":"SCF 7.0 explicado en profundidad: guía práctica para entender el proceso de funding en Stellar","meta_default_description":"El Stellar Community Fund (SCF) es uno de los programas de financiamiento más relevantes del ecosistema Web3 cuando hablamos de impacto real, productos en producción y uso on-chain. Con el lanzamiento oficial de SCF 7.0 en enero de 2026, la Stellar Development Foundation (SDF) realizó uno de los rediseños más profundos del programa desde su creación.","meta_og_title":"SCF 7.0 explicado en profundidad: guía práctica para entender el proceso de funding en Stellar","meta_og_description":"El Stellar Community Fund (SCF) es uno de los programas de financiamiento más relevantes del ecosistema Web3 cuando hablamos de impacto real, productos en producción y uso on-chain. Con el lanzamiento oficial de SCF 7.0 en enero de 2026, la Stellar Development Foundation (SDF) realizó uno de los rediseños más profundos del programa desde su creación.","meta_twitter_title":"SCF 7.0 explicado en profundidad: guía práctica para entender el proceso de funding en Stellar","meta_twitter_description":"El Stellar Community Fund (SCF) es uno de los programas de financiamiento más relevantes del ecosistema Web3 cuando hablamos de impacto real, productos en producción y uso on-chain. Con el lanzamiento oficial de SCF 7.0 en enero de 2026, la Stellar Development Foundation (SDF) realizó uno de los rediseños más profundos del programa desde su creación.","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":"default","enforce_gated_content":false,"enable_popup_on_scroll":false,"email_capture_title":"Suscríbete para seguir leyendo","email_capture_message":"Este contenido es gratuito, pero debes estar suscrito a Tellus Cooperative para continuar leyendo.","email_capture_cta":"Suscríbete","estimated_reading_time":6,"estimated_reading_time_display":"6 minutos","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12","name":"Pau Koh","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/pau_headshot_1.png","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/thumb_pau_headshot_1.png"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/landscape_pau_headshot_1.png"}},"bio":"𝘊𝘔𝘎𝘙/𝘛𝘦𝘭𝘭𝘶𝘴 𝘊𝘰𝘰𝘱𝘦𝘳𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘷𝘦","twitter_handle":"kl0ren","facebook_url":null,"instagram_url":null,"linkedin_url":null,"tiktok_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"discord_url":null,"bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[{"id":"4736ce87-6b98-48fc-aa4c-b23c818e1a23","display":"Stellar en Español","slug":"stellar-en-espanol"}],"created_at":"2026-01-20T11:53:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T13:59:35Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Este artículo no reemplaza al handbook oficial. Su objetivo es </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>traducirlo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>ordenarlo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>aterrizarlo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> para builders, equipos y comunidades —especialmente en LATAM— que quieren entender:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Qué es realmente SCF hoy</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Qué cambió con la versión 7.0</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Cómo funciona el proceso completo de aplicación</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Qué espera SCF de los equipos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Cómo maximizar tus probabilidades de avanzar</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://stellar.gitbook.io/scf-handbook\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Welcome to the SCF Handbook! | Stellar Community Fund - Handbook</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">This guide helps you understand the Stellar Community Fund, find the right program, and apply with confidence. This handbook is a source of truth document for the Stellar Community Fund (SCF).</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">stellar.gitbook.io/scf-handbook</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://stellar.gitbook.io/scf-handbook/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F4004211959-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252F4IGHJeoWQzABoSBkKBxt%252Fsocialpreview%252F0xK1jdlDAYL9qhb8K0pn%252FSlide%252016_9%2520-%252015%2520%282%29.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Dea4745be-c659-4fbc-b0dc-3531e1b3a141&amp;width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;sign=d4366327&amp;sv=2\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div id=\"1-qu-es-el-stellar-community-fund-s\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">1. ¿Qué es el Stellar Community Fund (SCF)?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar Community Fund</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> es el programa de financiamiento comunitario operado por la </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar Development Foundation (SDF)</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, diseñado para </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>impulsar proyectos que construyen valor real sobre Stellar y Soroban</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">A diferencia de muchos grants Web3, SCF:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">No se basa solo en ideas o promesas</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Prioriza </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>productos funcionales, métricas y ejecución</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Incorpora </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>evaluación comunitaria y gobernanza</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Acompaña a los equipos más allá del dinero</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF cubre todo el ciclo de vida de un proyecto:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx90\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx93\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-quote _1xtprv91\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"_1xtprv92\">❝</div><div class=\"_1xtprv90\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Idea → Desarrollo → Lanzamiento → Crecimiento</strong></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"2-qu-tipo-de-proyectos-busca-scf\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">2. ¿Qué tipo de proyectos busca SCF?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF está orientado a proyectos que aporten valor directo al ecosistema Stellar, por ejemplo:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Aplicaciones financieras y de pagos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Infraestructura y tooling para developers</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Integraciones con Soroban</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Productos que faciliten adopción real</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Casos de uso que aprovechen las fortalezas de Stellar</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">No importa si eres una startup, un equipo pequeño o un colectivo open source: </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>lo clave es el impacto y la capacidad de ejecutar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div id=\"3-el-punto-de-entrada-obligatorio-i\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">3. El punto de entrada obligatorio: Interest Form</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Todos los proyectos nuevos </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>sin excepción</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> comienzan por el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Interest Form</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> disponible en el sitio oficial de SCF.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Este formulario NO es todavía una aplicación completa. Es un filtro inicial que permite a SCF entender:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Qué problema estás resolviendo</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Por qué Stellar es la mejor tecnología para hacerlo</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En qué etapa se encuentra tu equipo</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si el proyecto calza con los objetivos actuales del programa</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"criterios-de-evaluacin-inicial\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Criterios de evaluación inicial</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El panel revisor analiza principalmente:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Valor potencial para Stellar / Soroban</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Alineación estratégica con SCF</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Capacidad real del equipo</strong></span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx90\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx93\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-quote _1xtprv91\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"_1xtprv92\">❝</div><div class=\"_1xtprv90\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">⚠️ Importante: pasar el Interest Form </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>no garantiza funding</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, solo habilita la posibilidad de ser invitado a una aplicación formal.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"4-scf-build-el-corazn-del-programa\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">4. SCF Build: el corazón del programa</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si tu proyecto pasa la evaluación inicial, puede ser invitado a postular a un </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>SCF Build Award</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, el principal track de financiamiento del programa.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF Build está diseñado para apoyar:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Desarrollo de producto</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Lanzamientos públicos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Iteración basada en usuarios reales</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"5-scf-70-cambios-estructurales-clav\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">5. SCF 7.0: cambios estructurales clave</span></h2></div><div id=\"51-tres-tracks-claros-de-scf-build\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">5.1 Tres tracks claros de SCF Build</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF 7.0 divide Build en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>tres tracks bien definidos</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, lo que mejora el encaje entre proyecto y evaluación:</span></p></div><div id=\"open-track\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h4 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx5\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Open Track</span></h4></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Para equipos con experiencia que estén construyendo </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>casos de uso nuevos o innovadores</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> sobre Stellar.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ideal si:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Tu proyecto no depende de integraciones existentes</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Estás creando algo original dentro del ecosistema</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"integration-track\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h4 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx5\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Integration Track</span></h4></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Pensado para proyectos que </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>integran soluciones ya existentes</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> del ecosistema Stellar.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ideal si:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Construyes sobre infra, protocolos o herramientas existentes</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Tu foco es adopción y conexión entre piezas del ecosistema</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"rfp-track\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h4 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx5\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">RFP Track</span></h4></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Dirigido a herramientas o soluciones que responden a un </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Request for Proposals activo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> publicado por SCF.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ideal si:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Detectas una necesidad explícita del ecosistema</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Tu proyecto calza exactamente con una RFP vigente</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"52-funding-por-tramos-tranches\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">5.2 Funding por tramos (Tranches)</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Uno de los cambios más importantes es la </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>distribución del funding en 4 tramos</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, cada uno ligado a entregables claros:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Tranche #0 – 10%</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: activación inicial</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Tranche #1 – 20%</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: progreso temprano</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Tranche #2 – 30%</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: ejecución avanzada</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Tranche #3 – 40%</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: cierre y resultados</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Este modelo busca:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Reducir riesgo</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Incentivar ejecución real</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Alinear incentivos entre SCF y los equipos</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"53-referral-program\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">5.3 Referral Program</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF 7.0 incorpora un </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>programa de referencias</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> desde actores clave del ecosistema Stellar.</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">No es obligatorio</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Pero actúa como una </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>señal fuerte de calidad</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Refuerza la confianza en el equipo</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En la práctica, tener referencias </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>aumenta significativamente la probabilidad de avanzar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, aunque no reemplaza la calidad del proyecto.</span></p></div><div id=\"54-lmites-de-funding\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">5.4 Límites de funding</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF establece límites claros para mantener equidad y foco:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Hasta </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>$150.000 USD en XLM</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> acumulados por proyecto</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En casos excepcionales, hasta </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>$300.000 USD</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, sujeto a evaluación adicional</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🔎</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Importante:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El valor se calcula según el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>precio del XLM al momento de cada pago</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">No según el precio actual del mercado</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"55-ms-apoyo-ms-all-del-dinero\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">5.5 Más apoyo más allá del dinero</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF 7.0 refuerza el acompañamiento a los equipos mediante:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Audit Bank</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>UX audits</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>User testing estructurado</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Apoyo en preparación de lanzamientos</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El objetivo es subir el estándar general de los productos que llegan al ecosistema.</span></p></div><div id=\"6-proyectos-previamente-financiados\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">6. Proyectos previamente financiados (Previously Funded Projects)</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Un proyecto se considera previamente financiado si recibió funding antes de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>SCF #41</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> (SCF 5.0 o 6.0).</span></p></div><div id=\"puedes-volver-a-postular-si\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Puedes volver a postular si:</span></h3></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Cumpliste correctamente todos los entregables anteriores</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Tu producto está </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>live y testeable</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Puedes demostrar </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>tracción real</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, idealmente on-chain</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Estos proyectos siguen sujetos a los mismos límites acumulados de funding.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si ya alcanzaste los $150k y crees que tu caso es excepcional, SCF evalúa solicitudes caso a caso.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">📩</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Contacto recomendado: </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7c1f13111109121508051a0912183c0f081910101d0e52130e1b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" data-skip-tracking=\"true\"><strong><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"f99a9694948c97908d809f8c979db98a8d9c9595988bd7968b9e\">[email&nbsp;protected]</span></strong></a></span></p></div><div id=\"7-comunidad-gobernanza-y-verified-m\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">7. Comunidad, gobernanza y Verified Members</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF es un programa </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>impulsado por la comunidad</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Algunos roles clave:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Verified Members</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: participan en votaciones y gobernanza</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Comunidad activa en Discord</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Transparencia en reporting y entregables</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Convertirse en Verified Member permite:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Apoyar proyectos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Participar en decisiones</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Entender desde dentro cómo evoluciona SCF</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"8-recomendaciones-prcticas-para-apl\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">8. Recomendaciones prácticas para aplicar</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Antes de enviar tu Interest Form:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ten claro </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>qué problema real resuelves</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Explica por qué </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar es clave</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> para tu solución</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Muestra señales de ejecución, aunque sean pequeñas</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Sé honesto sobre el estado real del proyecto</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF valora más un MVP funcionando que una presentación perfecta.</span></p></div><div id=\"9-conclusin\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">9. Conclusión</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">SCF 7.0 marca un punto de inflexión: </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>menos hype, más productos reales</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Para equipos que están construyendo con foco, disciplina y visión a largo plazo, el Stellar Community Fund sigue siendo una de las mejores puertas de entrada a:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Funding estructurado</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Validación del ecosistema</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Apoyo técnico y estratégico</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"fuente-oficial\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Fuente oficial</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Toda la información detallada, reglas completas y fechas actualizadas están disponibles en el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar Community Fund</strong></span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar Community Fund</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">The Stellar Community Fund is an open-application program that draws on community input to distribute awards to support projects built on Stellar and Soroban.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">communityfund.stellar.org</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/img/new-scf-card.png\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Este artículo es una guía editorial. El handbook es siempre la </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>fuente de verdad oficial</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></div>","publication":{"name":"Tellus Cooperative","description":"La Cooperativa Blockchain de LatAm","url":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/","twitter_url":"https://x.com/telluscoop","instagram_url":"https://instagram.com/telluscoop","linkedin_url":"https://linkedin.com/company/Tellus-Cooperative","youtube_url":"https://youtube.com/@telluscoop","discord_url":"https://discord.gg/V4eSGWA3PK"}}